WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 7=

02:02.940 --> 02:05.420
(Zhang Renjing)

02:09.340 --> 02:11.980
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

02:25.740 --> 02:29.380
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing,
Xu Mianmian)

02:43.500 --> 02:46.740
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

02:51.220 --> 02:55.060
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing,
Xu Mianmian)

03:00.980 --> 03:04.220
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing,
Xu Mianmian)

03:39.560 --> 03:41.330
The good times are almost here.

03:43.330 --> 03:43.970
What do you mean?

03:47.250 --> 03:48.000
In a few days,

03:48.720 --> 03:49.970
Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward

03:50.330 --> 03:51.330
will host the Peony Festival.

03:52.280 --> 03:52.810
Didn't you know?

04:03.090 --> 04:03.650
I know.

04:06.820 --> 04:11.620
(Five Days Before the Peony Festival)

04:12.020 --> 04:15.660
(Sigui Garden)

04:18.160 --> 04:18.570
Sir,

04:19.570 --> 04:20.800
are you here to see the black peony?

04:21.600 --> 04:22.240
You're too early.

04:22.800 --> 04:24.010
They won't bloom for a few more days.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.010
Thank you for letting me know.

04:53.620 --> 04:55.620
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

04:56.855 --> 05:02.325
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

05:02.691 --> 05:05.191
♪Books bear no blade♪

05:06.420 --> 05:11.050
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls
can pierce the sky♪

05:11.980 --> 05:14.047
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

05:14.048 --> 05:14.780
(Young Yan Shang)

05:14.840 --> 05:16.770
Mother, there's a well hidden here!

05:17.040 --> 05:19.010
Didn't Brother say he was thirsty
from walking?

05:19.010 --> 05:21.720
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

05:21.720 --> 05:22.650
Come, Shang.

05:23.090 --> 05:24.090
I'll draw some water for you both.

05:27.130 --> 05:27.770
Here, have some.

05:28.160 --> 05:28.600
Thank you, Mother.

05:28.820 --> 05:30.460
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪
(Young Yan Dalang)

05:32.040 --> 05:32.530
Mother,

05:33.090 --> 05:34.720
when will the black peony bloom?

05:35.210 --> 05:36.480
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother)
We've come a little too early.

05:37.210 --> 05:38.890
But even without the famous flowers,

05:39.690 --> 05:40.330
just look around,

05:40.970 --> 05:43.400
the garden is so peaceful,
with clouds reflected in the water...

05:44.010 --> 05:45.040
It's beautiful all the same.

05:46.800 --> 05:48.160
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

05:48.160 --> 05:49.400
Mother, look! A butterfly!

05:51.200 --> 05:53.360
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

05:53.460 --> 05:55.760
♪Rivers will bend♪

05:56.160 --> 05:59.400
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

06:00.630 --> 06:05.300
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

06:06.000 --> 06:08.960
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

07:02.330 --> 07:03.480
Xu Mianmian.

07:05.330 --> 07:06.090
Luling.

07:07.840 --> 07:08.570
Luling...

07:12.800 --> 07:13.530
Greetings, sir.

07:16.240 --> 07:17.629
So early in the morning,

07:17.671 --> 07:21.181
and you're already strolling
through the garden?

07:21.890 --> 07:22.840
You certainly know how
to enjoy yourself.

07:23.530 --> 07:24.450
Something's troubling me.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.010
I'm just wandering around.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.210
Since you're in no hurry,

07:32.400 --> 07:35.480
would you care to play a game of Go
with me?

07:37.280 --> 07:37.920
I'd be happy to.

07:38.650 --> 07:40.240
But we have no Go board here,

07:40.480 --> 07:41.090
nor any stones.

07:42.690 --> 07:45.130
Let the mind be our board
and our thoughts the stones.

07:45.400 --> 07:47.210
Who needs physical pieces?

07:48.160 --> 07:50.360
Would you care to join me

07:50.840 --> 07:52.360
for a game of Go without a board?

07:54.840 --> 07:56.130
(He's here for me.)

07:58.920 --> 07:59.650
(Who is he?)

08:00.240 --> 08:01.160
(Why me?)

08:02.160 --> 08:02.570
In that case,

08:03.240 --> 08:04.450
I'd be honored.

08:05.010 --> 08:07.090
Upper 6-3, corner approach.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.770
Upper 8-3, pincer attack.

08:09.210 --> 08:10.650
Upper 7-4, diagonal move.

08:11.040 --> 08:11.530
Upper...

08:12.650 --> 08:13.570
8-4, attachment.

08:14.360 --> 08:17.970
So young, yet you play by the book.

08:19.450 --> 08:20.650
Upper 7-6, jump.

08:21.970 --> 08:23.720
Judging by your clothes,

08:24.480 --> 08:26.330
you're preparing for the imperial exams.

08:26.480 --> 08:29.600
I imagine you're hoping to pass
with flying colors.

08:29.920 --> 08:30.280
Am I right?

08:32.290 --> 08:33.570
Upper 4-2, jump.

08:34.640 --> 08:35.290
To tell you the truth, sir,

08:36.120 --> 08:36.880
I came to the capital

08:37.720 --> 08:38.760
not to seek fame or office.

08:41.360 --> 08:42.810
Upper 5-2, diagonal move.

08:43.090 --> 08:43.720
Then why?

08:44.360 --> 08:45.240
Upper 3-7.

08:46.090 --> 08:47.240
I came to right

08:47.840 --> 08:48.640
a terrible wrong.

08:49.600 --> 08:51.120
Upper 8-5, hane.

08:52.840 --> 08:53.480
Young man,

08:53.970 --> 08:54.810
do you realize

08:55.290 --> 08:56.360
that in Sheng'an,

08:56.930 --> 08:58.210
wolves are in power,

08:58.520 --> 08:59.570
and injustices are

09:00.480 --> 09:02.410
far too many to count?

09:05.240 --> 09:06.210
Upper 6-5, peep.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.970
Then I'll right one if I can.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.930
Well said.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.880
You know there's a tiger
on the mountain,

09:13.290 --> 09:15.240
yet you head straight toward it.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.170
What courage!

09:18.640 --> 09:20.880
Upper 7-5, connect.

09:21.520 --> 09:22.290
Careful, sir.

09:23.330 --> 09:24.210
3-9.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.810
That's an excellent move!

09:29.760 --> 09:31.810
Upper 3-2, net.

09:40.210 --> 09:41.330
Got you!

09:45.970 --> 09:46.810
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

09:51.450 --> 09:52.640
My respects, Chancellor.

09:53.450 --> 09:54.480
Forgive my earlier discourtesy.

09:55.170 --> 09:56.360
I meant no disrespect.

09:57.690 --> 09:59.410
You two, honestly!

10:00.450 --> 10:02.360
Your timing couldn't be worse!

10:02.640 --> 10:05.290
The game was just getting interesting.

10:06.640 --> 10:07.690
Never mind. Let's go.

10:13.810 --> 10:14.450
Young man,

10:15.570 --> 10:16.480
don't forget,

10:17.240 --> 10:18.720
you and I still have

10:19.120 --> 10:20.570
an unfinished game.

10:24.000 --> 10:24.480
Yes.

10:55.640 --> 10:56.120
Scissors.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.840
What are you grinning about?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.360
Was I smiling?

11:08.810 --> 11:09.240
Scissors.

11:13.600 --> 11:14.810
Ever since you went out,

11:14.970 --> 11:16.290
you've been grinning to yourself.

11:17.930 --> 11:19.090
Did something good happen?

11:19.840 --> 11:20.760
Did you see your sweetheart?

11:22.210 --> 11:23.240
What sweetheart?

11:23.720 --> 11:24.480
I don't have one!

11:26.330 --> 11:27.360
What do you like about Yan Shang?

11:28.640 --> 11:29.170
No!

11:29.480 --> 11:30.520
I was thinking about Liu Wenji.

11:32.330 --> 11:33.520
Then what do you like about Liu Wenji?

11:36.640 --> 11:38.240
I'm not even sure if it's love.

11:38.810 --> 11:41.640
I suppose love means always
wanting to see someone

11:42.330 --> 11:44.000
and never wanting to leave
when you're together.

11:46.810 --> 11:48.170
How did you know exactly
what I was thinking?

11:49.600 --> 11:50.360
You like him.

11:51.640 --> 11:53.520
But does he like you?

11:56.120 --> 11:56.600
I don't know.

11:57.330 --> 11:58.170
But I could ask him.

11:58.450 --> 11:58.880
Ask him?

11:59.360 --> 12:00.210
How would you do that?

12:01.970 --> 12:03.840
Liu Wenji invited me
to the Peony Festival.

12:04.210 --> 12:05.290
I could ask him then.

12:06.810 --> 12:07.290
But

12:07.970 --> 12:09.360
I haven't asked for your permission yet.

12:10.360 --> 12:11.930
If you say no, I won't go.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.360
Go if you want to.

12:14.970 --> 12:16.690
I won't be the villain
who keeps two lovers apart.

12:17.880 --> 12:18.600
But

12:19.640 --> 12:20.360
you should know

12:21.000 --> 12:23.090
life is already hard enough for women.

12:24.050 --> 12:25.970
Don't give your heart away too easily.

12:32.570 --> 12:33.720
Your Highness, you're teasing me.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.840
If the day ever comes

12:37.410 --> 12:38.720
when my dear Chunhua gets married,

12:39.290 --> 12:42.090
I'll give you the grandest wedding
send-off.

12:43.210 --> 12:44.640
Every young woman in Sheng'an

12:45.240 --> 12:45.970
will envy you.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.050
No!

12:52.000 --> 12:52.480
I won't marry.

12:53.810 --> 12:54.840
I want to stay with you forever,
Your Highness.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.600
Don't be silly.

12:57.240 --> 12:57.930
How sappy!

13:04.570 --> 13:06.210
Your Highness, why have you
embroidered so many fish?

13:07.360 --> 13:08.120
What bad luck!

13:11.640 --> 13:12.810
This year's imperial exams

13:13.170 --> 13:14.120
are fast approaching.

13:14.840 --> 13:16.810
You must focus entirely on your studies.

13:17.690 --> 13:18.410
Class dismissed.

13:21.520 --> 13:22.930
Thank you, sir.

13:23.940 --> 13:29.180
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent)

13:40.930 --> 13:41.330
Yan Shang.

13:44.360 --> 13:44.810
Yan Shang?

13:49.240 --> 13:50.720
What's got you so lost in thought?

13:53.210 --> 13:55.000
I've been thinking about
an unfinished game of Go.

13:55.880 --> 13:56.880
The imperial exams are almost here,

13:57.690 --> 13:58.880
and you still have time
to think about Go?

14:00.240 --> 14:02.050
This morning, at Sigui Garden
in Jinchang Ward,

14:02.330 --> 14:03.240
I happened to meet
an elderly gentleman.

14:03.840 --> 14:04.840
We played a game of Go.

14:05.600 --> 14:07.000
Later, I heard someone call him

14:07.640 --> 14:08.210
Chancellor Liu.

14:08.640 --> 14:09.360
Chancellor Liu?

14:11.570 --> 14:12.690
What was he doing at Sigui Garden?

14:16.810 --> 14:18.410
Well, there's something
you two don't know.

14:22.810 --> 14:23.600
Sigui Garden

14:24.210 --> 14:26.000
was once the residence
of the late Chancellor Ma.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.720
Scholars often held
literary gatherings there.

14:28.880 --> 14:31.760
I hear Chancellor Liu often
attended them in his youth,

14:31.970 --> 14:33.170
reciting poetry
and discussing philosophy.

14:34.170 --> 14:35.330
But nowadays,

14:35.760 --> 14:37.480
the garden has changed hands
several times.

14:37.720 --> 14:38.570
The place remains,
but the people are gone.

14:39.930 --> 14:40.640
Perhaps

14:41.360 --> 14:42.720
Chancellor Liu was feeling nostalgic.

14:44.810 --> 14:45.240
Yan Shang.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.290
You really are lucky.

14:47.810 --> 14:49.360
You met someone so influential
just by taking a stroll.

14:51.000 --> 14:51.690
I see.

14:53.050 --> 14:53.360
Oh, by the way,

14:54.840 --> 14:56.970
there's a rare black peony
in Sigui Garden.

14:57.410 --> 14:58.720
Every year during the Peony Festival,

14:59.000 --> 15:01.090
people from all over
the capital flock there.

15:01.480 --> 15:02.600
After the Rebellion
of the Seven Garrisons,

15:02.840 --> 15:05.050
nearly all the capital's famous temples
and gardens were destroyed.

15:05.330 --> 15:08.450
But the black peony at Sigui Garden
miraculously survived.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.840
That's why the festival
has grown so popular.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.570
Nobles gather there every year.

15:12.880 --> 15:13.520
Even...

15:19.050 --> 15:21.120
Even Grand Princess Luling

15:21.480 --> 15:22.760
attends in person every year.

15:23.570 --> 15:24.000
I hear

15:24.360 --> 15:27.290
she even has her own private pavilion
in the garden.

15:27.880 --> 15:29.640
Someone like Grand Princess Luling

15:30.090 --> 15:30.880
also enjoys flowers too?

15:31.640 --> 15:32.330
Wei Shu,

15:32.690 --> 15:34.050
she's certainly not there
for the flowers.

15:34.810 --> 15:36.210
Haven't you two heard?

15:39.810 --> 15:40.930
The Grand Princess

15:41.360 --> 15:42.930
often uses festivals as an excuse

15:43.290 --> 15:44.290
to choose new male favorites

15:45.360 --> 15:46.450
and have secret rendezvous.

15:49.090 --> 15:50.240
She's a Grand Princess.

15:51.050 --> 15:52.290
Doing such things in secret,

15:53.090 --> 15:54.450
isn't she afraid of putting herself
in danger?

15:55.000 --> 15:56.640
She takes guards everywhere she goes.

15:57.170 --> 15:59.000
She's surrounded by attendants
inside and out.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.170
Besides,

16:00.410 --> 16:01.480
who in Sheng'an

16:01.970 --> 16:03.240
would dare lay a finger on her?

16:04.760 --> 16:06.170
Last year, some fool

16:06.570 --> 16:07.699
barged into her private pavilion

16:07.741 --> 16:08.711
to present his writings to her.

16:09.290 --> 16:11.360
Unfortunately, he was hideously ugly.

16:11.450 --> 16:12.290
A real eyesore.

16:12.640 --> 16:14.410
The Grand Princess was furious.

16:14.640 --> 16:16.120
She immediately had her guards
drag him out

16:16.360 --> 16:17.290
and beat him to death.

16:18.760 --> 16:20.210
A man's life was taken just like that,

16:20.840 --> 16:21.880
and no one dared question it.

16:23.520 --> 16:24.840
At this year's festival,

16:25.120 --> 16:26.429
I wonder how many

16:26.471 --> 16:28.469
handsome young men she'll choose

16:28.511 --> 16:29.671
to become her male favorites.

16:30.120 --> 16:30.570
Feng Xianyu,

16:30.970 --> 16:32.360
how did it go with your writings
yesterday?

16:34.720 --> 16:35.240
I...

16:35.760 --> 16:36.840
Yesterday, I...

16:37.360 --> 16:37.840
Mr. Zhao.

16:39.720 --> 16:40.810
Writings, Writings!

16:41.170 --> 16:42.840
At least you have decent writing
to show.

16:43.090 --> 16:43.570
But me?

16:43.930 --> 16:45.360
My essays are complete rubbish!

16:45.570 --> 16:47.290
My father would break my legs
if he had to read another one!

16:48.930 --> 16:50.120
You're being too modest, Zhao.

16:50.570 --> 16:51.480
(Zhao, Student at the Imperial Academy)
Just look at me!

16:51.970 --> 16:52.480
Do I

16:52.880 --> 16:53.930
look like I'm being modest?

16:55.480 --> 16:56.640
If my father hadn't forced me,

16:56.970 --> 16:58.840
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent)
I'd never have set foot in this academy!

16:59.520 --> 17:00.840
He gained admission through
family privilege

17:01.570 --> 17:02.600
and had his elders looking out
for him.

17:04.130 --> 17:05.610
What more could he ask for?

17:08.650 --> 17:09.890
(Peony Festival...)

17:10.690 --> 17:12.280
(The Grand Princess attends
every year...)

17:13.320 --> 17:14.210
(Private Pavilion...)

17:19.040 --> 17:19.410
Mr. Zhao!

17:20.800 --> 17:21.240
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent)
Mr. Zhao!

17:22.850 --> 17:23.800
Mr. Zhao, wait!

17:24.720 --> 17:25.080
What is it?

17:26.000 --> 17:27.280
Could we speak in private?

17:33.040 --> 17:33.320
Come on.

17:36.130 --> 17:36.890
What do you want?

17:37.130 --> 17:38.170
Why all the secrecy?

17:39.520 --> 17:40.760
A man of your standing, Mr. Zhao,

17:41.210 --> 17:43.240
shouldn't have to worry
about a few essays.

17:45.210 --> 17:45.720
Unlike me.

17:46.450 --> 17:47.410
Apart from writing,

17:47.610 --> 17:48.610
I have nothing to offer.

17:49.560 --> 17:50.480
If you're interested, Mr. Zhao,

17:53.320 --> 17:55.000
I could provide you with a few essays

17:55.610 --> 17:56.760
to present to potential patrons.

17:58.170 --> 17:59.170
You'd do that for me?

18:02.930 --> 18:04.480
You're not giving them away for free,
are you?

18:07.040 --> 18:08.480
Nothing gets past you, Mr. Zhao.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.210
I've been rather

18:10.970 --> 18:11.760
short on money lately.

18:12.320 --> 18:13.410
As for the cost of writing materials,

18:13.930 --> 18:14.690
I wonder if you'd be willing

18:15.410 --> 18:16.320
to cover my expenses?

18:18.970 --> 18:19.800
Then we have a deal!

18:22.480 --> 18:23.210
Well... Didn't see that coming.

18:23.850 --> 18:25.320
Our teacher's always
praising your talent.

18:25.760 --> 18:27.450
Who knew you'd be practical enough
to do something like this?

18:28.890 --> 18:29.720
Even a gentleman needs money.

18:30.130 --> 18:31.080
Nothing to be ashamed of.

18:33.280 --> 18:33.650
So tell me,

18:34.520 --> 18:34.930
how much?

18:40.760 --> 18:41.560
That much?

18:41.970 --> 18:43.170
I could buy myself a top courtesan
for that!

18:44.850 --> 18:46.480
It might be expensive for others,

18:47.000 --> 18:48.000
but for someone like you,

18:48.520 --> 18:49.800
it's just the cost of a few banquets.

18:55.320 --> 18:55.720
Fine.

18:56.240 --> 18:56.800
I'll pay.

18:57.690 --> 18:58.480
But let's get one thing straight.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.280
Those essays had better be good!

19:00.520 --> 19:01.080
And write plenty of them!

19:01.280 --> 19:02.000
Rest assured, Mr. Zhao.

19:03.080 --> 19:03.520
Thank you.

19:04.130 --> 19:04.520
I'll be off.

19:07.040 --> 19:07.610
It's a deal.

19:10.620 --> 19:15.460
(Two Days Before the Peony Festival)

19:15.930 --> 19:16.240
Sir.

19:17.760 --> 19:18.210
Young man.

19:18.850 --> 19:19.480
(Sigui Garden)
We meet again.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.240
You certainly are eager.

19:21.610 --> 19:23.650
The black peony won't bloom
for another two days.

19:24.930 --> 19:26.210
I have nothing else to do,

19:26.720 --> 19:28.320
so I thought I'd enjoy the garden
while it's quiet.

19:30.130 --> 19:30.410
By the way,

19:31.080 --> 19:31.760
I've heard

19:31.850 --> 19:34.040
Grand Princess Luling
has a private pavilion in the garden.

19:34.320 --> 19:35.800
Which one is it?

19:36.240 --> 19:37.930
Whenever the Grand Princess
comes to see the flowers,

19:38.040 --> 19:39.720
she takes over Jifang Pavilion.

19:44.410 --> 19:45.040
To tell you the truth, sir,

19:45.610 --> 19:47.240
I haven't found anyone willing
to back me lately.

19:47.690 --> 19:48.690
When the Grand Princess arrives,

19:49.280 --> 19:50.170
might I request an audience?

19:51.000 --> 19:51.370
Sir,

19:51.800 --> 19:52.520
you mustn't.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.450
The Grand Princess forbids anyone
from disturbing her during her visits.

19:55.760 --> 19:57.520
Last year, a young man knocked
on her door seeking an audience.

19:57.800 --> 19:58.800
She wouldn't even open the door.

19:58.890 --> 20:01.130
Her guards came out
and beat him half to death!

20:05.000 --> 20:06.040
Thank you for the warning, sir.

20:22.170 --> 20:22.560
Wenji.

20:24.450 --> 20:24.850
Wenji.

20:27.690 --> 20:28.240
You're back.

20:30.370 --> 20:32.320
An old servant just delivered a chest.

20:33.000 --> 20:33.850
He said

20:34.280 --> 20:36.520
his master was surnamed... Zhao.

20:47.650 --> 20:47.970
Shang.

20:48.970 --> 20:49.760
These money...

20:51.560 --> 20:53.080
I wrote some essays for him.

20:53.170 --> 20:54.720
This is my payment.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.000
You...

20:58.800 --> 20:59.690
Are you short on money?

21:00.370 --> 21:01.370
Why didn't you tell me?

21:01.480 --> 21:02.320
I could've lent you some!

21:05.000 --> 21:06.520
We're friends. There's no need
to talk about loans.

21:07.480 --> 21:08.040
I'm not short of money.

21:08.320 --> 21:08.890
I just need more of it.

21:09.370 --> 21:10.170
Living in the capital is expensive.

21:10.610 --> 21:11.760
You should save your money too.

21:15.560 --> 21:16.930
If I'm not mistaken,

21:17.970 --> 21:19.650
you had a lovestruck look on your face
just now.

21:22.850 --> 21:23.720
I asked Chunhua

21:24.650 --> 21:26.970
to go to the Peony Festival
with me in two days.

21:28.850 --> 21:31.040
So you've got two happy occasions
coming up!

21:32.970 --> 21:33.690
Congratulations!

21:35.040 --> 21:35.890
What two occasions?

21:37.800 --> 21:38.690
Passing the imperial exams

21:39.040 --> 21:39.890
and getting married.

21:40.320 --> 21:41.480
What could be better than that?

21:45.970 --> 21:46.370
Shang.

21:47.080 --> 21:48.170
As for the imperial exams,

21:48.610 --> 21:50.410
I can study hard and earn my success.

21:51.170 --> 21:52.240
But marriage is another matter.

21:59.890 --> 22:01.240
Even if I truly wanted to marry her,

22:01.800 --> 22:02.280
I'm afraid

22:02.800 --> 22:04.040
my father would never approve.

22:05.080 --> 22:05.690
After all,

22:07.000 --> 22:08.040
she's only a...

22:09.320 --> 22:09.650
She's...

22:14.850 --> 22:15.970
Whether you two end up together

22:16.650 --> 22:18.130
ultimately depends on what you want.

22:32.930 --> 22:34.170
It's too early to talk about that.

22:36.760 --> 22:37.690
I need to go out.

22:38.170 --> 22:39.370
Don't wait for me for dinner.

22:41.370 --> 22:41.760
Shang.

22:42.610 --> 22:43.450
Where are you going?

22:44.930 --> 22:47.210
To see what it's like
to spend a fortune.

22:54.170 --> 22:54.890
This money

22:55.480 --> 22:56.480
should be enough to buy your freedom.

23:03.040 --> 23:04.040
I can't accept something for nothing.

23:05.170 --> 23:06.560
Please tell me what you want.

23:08.480 --> 23:08.890
It's nothing difficult.

23:09.760 --> 23:10.560
All I need is for you

23:11.040 --> 23:12.410
to do me one small favor.

23:16.410 --> 23:19.690
(Sharpening scissors!
Kitchen knives for sale!)

23:20.560 --> 23:22.189
(Get your scissors sharpened!)

23:22.231 --> 23:25.469
(Come take a look!
Beautiful patterned cloth!)

23:25.511 --> 23:25.881
Sir.

23:26.450 --> 23:27.610
Need your scissors sharpened?
Or want a kitchen knife?

23:33.720 --> 23:34.130
Sir,

23:34.850 --> 23:35.970
how much is this little knife?

23:36.450 --> 23:37.040
This one?

23:37.410 --> 23:37.970
Fifty.

23:41.280 --> 23:41.800
Young man,

23:42.170 --> 23:43.040
take a look at this one.

23:44.320 --> 23:45.280
Fine craftsmanship, quality steel.

23:45.690 --> 23:46.720
Only three hundred.

23:50.610 --> 23:51.040
No, thank you.

23:52.610 --> 23:53.130
Sir.

23:53.610 --> 23:54.800
I'll be straight with you.

23:55.690 --> 23:57.210
This knife may be cheap,

23:57.520 --> 23:58.720
but after just a few uses,

23:59.610 --> 24:00.760
the blade will probably go dull.

24:01.520 --> 24:02.130
When it comes to knives,

24:02.320 --> 24:03.450
it's worth paying more.

24:03.760 --> 24:04.610
It may cost a little extra,

24:04.890 --> 24:06.130
but it'll last you for years.

24:06.280 --> 24:06.930
Thank you, sir.

24:07.520 --> 24:08.210
Once will be enough.

24:09.080 --> 24:10.040
All right. Thank you!

24:11.930 --> 24:12.690
Take care.

24:15.210 --> 24:17.130
(Get your scissors sharpened!)

25:12.450 --> 25:13.320
Captain! It's me! It's me!

25:13.520 --> 25:13.970
It's me!

25:17.210 --> 25:18.560
So you're already awake, Captain.

25:19.280 --> 25:20.210
I was just wondering

25:20.410 --> 25:22.240
how hard I'd have to slap you
to wake you up.

25:24.370 --> 25:26.800
I've crawled out of piles of corpses.

25:27.610 --> 25:29.189
I never sleep that deeply.

25:29.231 --> 25:30.301
You think I need you to slap me awake?

25:31.000 --> 25:31.410
Of course.

25:31.800 --> 25:32.690
What is it? Spit it out!

25:49.240 --> 25:50.389
Well, well!

25:50.431 --> 25:51.711
Her personal handkerchief.

25:52.850 --> 25:53.520
Smells lovely!

25:54.930 --> 25:56.800
Congratulations, Captain.
You've gotten your wish.

25:57.130 --> 26:00.650
That little minx actually said yes?

26:00.850 --> 26:01.520
Rest assured, Captain.

26:02.170 --> 26:04.930
Xu Mianmian simply didn't appreciate
your sincere feelings before.

26:05.520 --> 26:06.690
Once I explained everything,

26:07.040 --> 26:08.080
she was filled with regret.

26:08.930 --> 26:10.560
That's why she asked me to deliver
this embroidered handkerchief

26:11.040 --> 26:12.130
as a token of her affection.

26:15.280 --> 26:17.170
At least she knows what's good for her!

26:17.480 --> 26:19.280
Xu Mianmian also asked me to tell you

26:19.800 --> 26:22.480
that she'd like to meet you
at Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward

26:22.930 --> 26:24.210
to satisfy her longing for you.

26:32.930 --> 26:33.760
But...

26:35.650 --> 26:37.560
if that little minx wants to be with me,

26:38.890 --> 26:40.480
why meet in a garden?

26:41.520 --> 26:42.610
There's something you should know,
Captain.

26:43.320 --> 26:44.720
In two days, Sigui Garden

26:45.320 --> 26:46.650
will host the Peony Festival.

26:47.040 --> 26:48.320
It's quite a spectacular event.

26:49.040 --> 26:52.210
The garden has secluded pavilions
hidden among the flowers and trees.

26:53.040 --> 26:54.130
A secret rendezvous there...

26:54.850 --> 26:55.370
Wouldn't that

26:56.410 --> 26:57.760
add a little excitement?

27:01.650 --> 27:03.800
You're getting me all worked up!

27:05.370 --> 27:06.690
You sly devil!

27:07.720 --> 27:09.720
You scholars have all sorts of tricks.

27:10.240 --> 27:10.890
You know how to have fun.

27:12.000 --> 27:12.320
Good.

27:13.760 --> 27:14.080
Good.

27:14.760 --> 27:15.970
You've done a fine job!

27:16.720 --> 27:18.720
From now on, your recommendations,

27:19.080 --> 27:19.800
your official career...

27:21.410 --> 27:21.890
Leave it all to me!

27:24.520 --> 27:26.720
It's my honor to be of service, Captain.

27:28.320 --> 27:28.690
Good!

29:16.420 --> 29:18.500
(One Day Before the Peony Festival)
(Bright Virtue)

29:18.560 --> 29:19.410
(Virtuous and Learned)
(You go ahead to the dining hall.)

29:19.760 --> 29:20.560
(I'm going back to my dormitory.)

29:20.800 --> 29:21.210
(All right.)

29:22.040 --> 29:22.429
(See you tomorrow.)

29:22.471 --> 29:23.119
(Thank you for your hard work, sir.)

29:23.161 --> 29:23.441
(All right.)

29:24.610 --> 29:25.080
(Let's go.)

29:26.080 --> 29:26.610
(Hurry to the dining hall.)

29:27.890 --> 29:28.240
(Wait for me.)

29:30.610 --> 29:31.040
Sir.

29:33.040 --> 29:34.800
I'd like to request a day off tomorrow.

29:36.690 --> 29:37.410
What for?

29:39.080 --> 29:40.040
I've heard

29:40.370 --> 29:42.450
there's a Peony Festival
in Jinchang Ward tomorrow.

29:42.930 --> 29:43.890
It's one of Sheng'an's grandest events.

29:44.560 --> 29:45.690
I'd really love to see it.

29:46.130 --> 29:46.970
I was hoping...

29:48.930 --> 29:49.480
I'd say

29:50.080 --> 29:51.450
you're not really interested
in the flowers.

29:52.970 --> 29:54.610
You're hoping to find
a powerful supporter, aren't you?

30:00.210 --> 30:00.560
Fair enough.

30:01.410 --> 30:02.720
The annual Peony Festival
is a fine opportunity

30:03.280 --> 30:05.560
for scholars like you to win
the influential officials' favor.

30:05.970 --> 30:06.280
Very well.

30:07.130 --> 30:07.480
You may go.

30:08.480 --> 30:09.210
Thank you, sir.

30:22.450 --> 30:23.450
When you left,

30:23.690 --> 30:25.080
the prince and I had just
gotten married.

30:25.890 --> 30:27.210
Now three years have passed,

30:27.760 --> 30:29.650
(Liang Lingyi, Princess Consort of Jin)
and I still haven't borne him a child.

30:31.410 --> 30:32.040
Wanyao,

30:32.650 --> 30:33.850
of everyone in Sheng'an,

30:34.410 --> 30:35.410
I think you're the only one

30:35.930 --> 30:37.320
who truly understands my suffering.

30:39.080 --> 30:39.800
I don't understand.

30:41.890 --> 30:42.170
But...

30:43.240 --> 30:45.370
You were married for three years
without having children too.

30:57.210 --> 30:59.760
I've never intended to bear children
for anyone.

31:01.480 --> 31:02.370
I'm afraid you've misunderstood me.

31:04.690 --> 31:06.410
Even if your husband is gone,

31:06.480 --> 31:07.800
you shouldn't say things like that.

31:08.320 --> 31:09.720
You're a princess of the Huai Dynasty.

31:10.370 --> 31:11.280
Remarrying would be easy for you.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.720
Besides, you're still young.

31:14.240 --> 31:16.280
Don't worry. You can still
have children.

31:20.610 --> 31:21.760
Then let's hope you're right.

31:25.320 --> 31:26.240
Have you heard?

31:26.890 --> 31:29.000
The Peony Goddess at Sigui Garden

31:29.210 --> 31:31.080
is said to grant prayers for children.

31:32.850 --> 31:33.320
Cailian.

31:34.080 --> 31:34.650
Put these away.

31:35.520 --> 31:35.890
Yes, Your Highness.

31:41.370 --> 31:43.000
The Peony Festival is tomorrow.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.800
Why not come with me?

31:45.210 --> 31:46.080
I'll pray for a child,

31:46.450 --> 31:48.080
and you can draw a fortune for love.

31:49.210 --> 31:50.210
Thank you for the kind invitation.

31:50.850 --> 31:53.130
The festival will be crowded.

31:54.210 --> 31:54.930
I'm not used to crowds.

32:05.760 --> 32:06.210
All right, then.

32:07.040 --> 32:08.320
You should think carefully

32:08.720 --> 32:10.560
about what a woman's life is really for.

32:11.130 --> 32:12.450
If you change your mind,

32:12.760 --> 32:13.760
send someone to the Prince of Jin's
residence

32:14.210 --> 32:15.240
to let me know.

32:15.690 --> 32:16.000
All right.

32:17.650 --> 32:18.450
Let me see you out.

32:18.850 --> 32:19.450
No need.

32:30.720 --> 32:32.040
Your Highness, Yang Si is here.

32:32.850 --> 32:33.800
What does he want this time?

32:38.170 --> 32:39.040
Did I say you could come in?

32:41.000 --> 32:41.760
How did you get in here?

32:41.930 --> 32:43.520
Well, nobody told me I couldn't.

32:43.970 --> 32:45.280
I know this residence
like the back of my hand.

32:45.650 --> 32:47.040
I could find my way to you
with my eyes closed.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.650
Well? What do you want?

32:51.080 --> 32:54.450
The Peony Festival at Sigui Garden
in Jinchang Ward is tomorrow.

32:56.370 --> 32:57.560
I... I'll take you.

32:58.040 --> 32:58.450
Not interested.

32:59.410 --> 33:00.210
Why not?

33:00.800 --> 33:02.170
If you're not going with me,
who else would you go with?

33:02.410 --> 33:03.410
That man named Wei Shu?

33:05.170 --> 33:05.930
You're too late.

33:07.040 --> 33:08.450
I'm going with the Princess Consort
of Jin.

33:10.210 --> 33:11.560
What are you going with her for?

33:12.240 --> 33:13.080
To pray for a child.

33:44.080 --> 33:45.280
(Besides, you're still young.)

33:45.800 --> 33:46.450
(Don't worry.)

33:46.970 --> 33:48.040
(You can still have children.)

33:57.450 --> 33:57.760
Shang.

33:58.320 --> 33:58.850
How's my ironing?

33:59.320 --> 33:59.760
Is it smooth enough?

34:01.450 --> 34:01.850
Looks good.

34:03.080 --> 34:03.720
You're not even looking.

34:08.600 --> 34:08.970
Wenji.

34:10.410 --> 34:11.080
Get some rest.

34:11.600 --> 34:12.290
I'm going for a walk.

34:13.850 --> 34:14.410
At this hour?

34:14.890 --> 34:15.480
Aren't you going to bed?

34:15.770 --> 34:16.330
I can't sleep.

34:32.460 --> 34:36.900
(Auspicious Blessings Fill the Streets)

34:39.800 --> 34:43.560
(Fragrances Shop)

35:04.120 --> 35:04.520
Your Highness.

35:04.890 --> 35:05.560
It's time to rest.

35:09.640 --> 35:10.250
I can't sleep.

35:10.850 --> 35:11.480
You go get some rest.

35:13.160 --> 35:14.080
I'd like to stay up a little longer.

35:21.520 --> 35:22.200
If you don't leave,

35:22.930 --> 35:24.040
you'll have to drink with me.

35:27.850 --> 35:28.330
Your Highness,

35:29.640 --> 35:31.040
that day Shang came to the residence,

35:32.480 --> 35:33.480
I was the one who invited him.

35:34.080 --> 35:35.000
Why did you invite him?

35:36.040 --> 35:37.040
Were you trying to drive Yang Si mad?

35:37.970 --> 35:40.080
How was I supposed to know
he'd run into Yang Si?

35:40.560 --> 35:41.890
You've had trouble sleeping for years.

35:42.600 --> 35:44.250
The only time you slept well
was in Lingnan.

35:45.290 --> 35:45.850
So I thought

35:46.250 --> 35:47.770
perhaps it was because Shang was
with you.

35:48.250 --> 35:49.370
He's always been good with words.

35:50.600 --> 35:52.520
I thought if I invited Shang over

35:52.930 --> 35:54.640
to keep you company
like he did in Lingnan,

35:54.930 --> 35:56.000
perhaps you'd sleep better.

35:56.770 --> 35:57.770
You silly girl.

35:58.450 --> 35:59.890
Where do you get these ideas?

36:13.620 --> 36:15.900
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

36:17.940 --> 36:20.060
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

36:26.250 --> 36:27.250
What's he doing here?

36:29.970 --> 36:30.890
Yan Shang.

36:32.680 --> 36:33.450
I'll go bring him in.

36:51.250 --> 36:51.640
Your Highness.

36:59.000 --> 37:00.410
In the middle of the night,

37:00.850 --> 37:02.410
lurking outside my residence...

37:03.640 --> 37:04.890
What mischief are you up to?

37:06.930 --> 37:07.730
I couldn't sleep tonight.

37:08.520 --> 37:09.970
So I decided to take a walk.

37:10.810 --> 37:12.600
I must've wandered farther
than I intended.

37:14.680 --> 37:15.520
So,

37:16.080 --> 37:17.160
you just happened

37:17.850 --> 37:18.810
to end up here?

37:20.250 --> 37:20.730
I suppose so.

37:22.250 --> 37:23.330
And why did you invite me inside,

37:24.770 --> 37:25.730
Your Highness?

37:32.330 --> 37:33.160
It's a long, dull night.

37:33.930 --> 37:34.970
I summoned you to tell me a story.

38:00.850 --> 38:02.160
What kind of story would you
like to hear, Your Highness?

38:04.640 --> 38:06.810
I thought you'd ask me why,

38:07.890 --> 38:09.040
or fly into a rage

38:09.680 --> 38:10.600
and storm off.

38:22.120 --> 38:22.560
Your Highness,

38:24.770 --> 38:25.600
it's cold at this hour.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.080
Drinking could harm your health.

38:35.000 --> 38:36.040
Why are your hands so cold?

38:37.810 --> 38:38.730
Can't you afford warm clothes?

38:41.330 --> 38:42.080
I was in such a hurry to get here,

38:42.930 --> 38:43.930
I forgot to put on a cloak.

38:46.770 --> 38:47.850
Don't try to make me pity you.

38:48.640 --> 38:49.930
If your story is good,

38:51.200 --> 38:52.250
I'll give you that cloak

38:52.810 --> 38:53.890
as a reward.

38:56.450 --> 38:58.730
You certainly have plenty of cloaks,
Your Highness.

39:08.450 --> 39:09.160
Go on.

39:09.810 --> 39:10.520
Tell me

39:11.080 --> 39:11.930
whatever you wish.

39:20.120 --> 39:21.600
Then I'll tell Your Highness

39:22.520 --> 39:24.120
a story about a venomous snake
and a hornet.

39:28.890 --> 39:29.560
Once upon a time,

39:30.160 --> 39:31.160
there was a venomous snake.

39:32.000 --> 39:32.890
It was being chased by humans.

39:33.930 --> 39:35.370
At its most vulnerable moment,

39:36.080 --> 39:37.330
it encountered a hornet.

39:38.250 --> 39:39.850
One crawled on the ground,

39:40.080 --> 39:41.080
while the other flew through the air.

39:42.200 --> 39:43.520
Their paths should never have crossed.

39:44.410 --> 39:44.930
But unexpectedly,

39:46.080 --> 39:47.410
the hornet suddenly swooped down

39:47.890 --> 39:50.160
and stung the snake viciously
on the head.

39:51.810 --> 39:53.120
Did the snake die from the sting?

39:55.040 --> 39:55.410
No.

39:56.890 --> 39:58.120
Its fate was far worse.

39:59.370 --> 40:02.040
The hornet's venom remained
inside the snake's head.

40:02.930 --> 40:04.600
Day after day, year after year,

40:05.520 --> 40:07.640
it suffered constant, burning agony.

40:09.410 --> 40:09.890
And so,

40:11.080 --> 40:12.480
the pain lasted ten whole years.

40:14.160 --> 40:15.120
Unable to bear the pain,

40:16.200 --> 40:17.970
the snake searched everywhere
for the hornet.

40:18.810 --> 40:20.000
It searched for many years.

40:21.680 --> 40:23.200
But one crawled on the ground,

40:23.930 --> 40:25.000
while the other flew through the air.

40:25.890 --> 40:27.040
How could it ever find the hornet?

40:28.640 --> 40:29.120
And yet,

40:30.040 --> 40:30.930
fate had other plans.

40:31.560 --> 40:32.579
One day, the snake

40:32.621 --> 40:33.831
crossed paths with that same hornet.

40:34.640 --> 40:36.520
The very one that had stung its head.

40:38.330 --> 40:40.200
The snake invited the hornet
to travel with it.

40:41.330 --> 40:41.770
Sure enough,

40:42.520 --> 40:43.810
the hornet hadn't changed its ways

40:44.330 --> 40:45.200
and tried to sting the snake again.

40:46.410 --> 40:48.560
But this time, the snake didn't flee.

40:48.970 --> 40:50.850
Instead, it willingly offered
up its head.

40:55.000 --> 40:57.810
Just as the hornet plunged its stinger
into the snake's head,

40:59.560 --> 41:00.450
the snake thrust its head

41:01.480 --> 41:03.250
beneath the wheel of a passing carriage.

41:05.370 --> 41:07.000
The snake's head and the hornet

41:08.250 --> 41:09.450
were crushed beneath the wheel.

41:11.600 --> 41:12.810
They were both dead.

41:15.120 --> 41:16.250
That was a terrible story.

41:17.520 --> 41:18.450
You're not getting that cloak.

41:19.160 --> 41:19.850
What was wrong with it?

41:24.040 --> 41:25.160
Even if the snake killed the hornet,

41:25.850 --> 41:27.000
it wouldn't cure the pain in its head.

41:28.160 --> 41:30.040
Such revenge would accomplish nothing.

41:30.890 --> 41:31.480
And worse still,

41:32.120 --> 41:33.080
they both ended up dead.

41:35.250 --> 41:36.680
There are countless ways
to kill a hornet

41:37.250 --> 41:38.200
and take revenge.

41:39.000 --> 41:40.770
Why sacrifice its own life to do it?

41:42.250 --> 41:43.160
Don't tell me

41:43.890 --> 41:44.640
such foolish stories again.

41:46.520 --> 41:47.730
You're absolutely right, Your Highness.

41:53.520 --> 41:54.600
(But if one day,)

41:55.330 --> 41:57.080
(I get the chance to kill my enemy
with my own hands,)

41:58.250 --> 42:00.290
(what does it matter if it's foolish?)

43:02.480 --> 43:02.970
Your Highness.

43:06.770 --> 43:07.410
I must leave.

44:03.500 --> 44:07.740
(Next Episode Preview)

44:09.450 --> 44:10.890
Seal off the entire garden!

44:11.000 --> 44:12.250
Until that filthy wretch is caught,

44:12.560 --> 44:13.600
no one is leaving!

44:14.080 --> 44:15.450
There's been a murder in the garden.

44:15.560 --> 44:18.000
Aunt! I heard someone
was killed in the garden!

44:18.330 --> 44:20.200
Aunt, I really can't stand
the sight of blood!

44:20.480 --> 44:21.520
Let her go! Let her go!

44:21.850 --> 44:22.520
You're the best!

44:24.481 --> 44:27.774
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:30.459 --> 44:35.375
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:37.569 --> 44:43.414
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

44:43.914 --> 44:49.140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

44:51.909 --> 44:56.700
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44:57.536 --> 45:03.615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:05.416 --> 45:08.566
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:08.566 --> 45:10.214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:10.266 --> 45:13.990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:14.368 --> 45:19.034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:19.653 --> 45:23.694
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:24.185 --> 45:26.300
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:26.340 --> 45:33.286
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:34.049 --> 45:37.502
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:37.682 --> 45:40.827
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

45:41.266 --> 45:47.903
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

45:48.300 --> 45:50.338
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

45:50.338 --> 45:52.814
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:52.852 --> 45:55.321
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:55.525 --> 46:02.412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:02.724 --> 46:05.995
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:06.300 --> 46:09.473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:09.797 --> 46:13.223
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:13.456 --> 46:16.681
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:17.012 --> 46:23.808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:24.177 --> 46:26.239
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:26.240 --> 46:28.743
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:28.790 --> 46:31.128
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:31.359 --> 46:38.194
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:38.543 --> 46:40.161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:40.291 --> 46:42.087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

46:42.444 --> 46:45.461
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:45.501 --> 46:46.828
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
